he language of instruction is English.\nIf your institution or country is not listed here, we may accept a medium of instruction letter verifying that your institution or program was fully taught in English.\nCountries in which English is the Official Language of Instruction\nThe U of A recognizes English as the official language of instruction in the following countries.\nApplicants with credentials from academic institutions in these countries will meet the English Language Requirement.\nA-F\nAmerican Samoa\nAnguilla\nAntigua and Barbuda\nAustralia\nBahamas\nBarbados\nBelize\nBermuda\nCanada\nCayman Islands\nEngland\nFalkland Islands\nFiji\nG-L\nGhana\nGibraltar\nGrenada\nGuam\nGuyana\nIreland (Northern)\nIreland (Republic of)\nJamaica\nKenya\nM-R\nMalta\nMauritius\nMontserrat\nNew Zealand\nNigeria\nRyukyu Islands\nS-Z\nScotland\nSeychelles\nSingapore\nSouth Africa\nSouth Pacific Islands\nSt. Helena\nSt. Kitts and Nevis\nSt. Lucia\nSt. Vincent and the Grenadines\nTrinidad and Tobago\nTurks and Caicos Islands\nUnited Kingdom\nUnited States of America\nVirgin Islands\nWales\nZimbabwe\nInternational Universities\nApplicants with credentials from the following institutions will meet the English Language Requirement.\nBangladesh\nBangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET)\nChittagong University of Engineering and Technology\nDhaka University of Engineering and Technology\nIndependent University\nIslamic University of Technology\nKhulna University of Engineering and Technology\nNorth South University\nRajshahi University of Engineering and Technology (RUET)\nShahjalal University of Science and Technology (Engineering programs only)\nBotswana\nUniversity of Botswana\nBulgaria\nAmerican University in Bulgaria\nCameroon\nUniversity of Buea\nEritrea\nUniversity of Asmara\nEthiopia\nAddis Ababa University\nAlemaya University\nJimma University\nEgypt\nAmerican University in Cairo\nGermany\nInternational University\nJacob's University\nHong Kong\nCity Universit